// Generated by tools/gen_examines_647.py -- do not edit desc= by hand;
// regenerate instead (a section's other keys are kept). 647's cache carries no
// examine text (it was server data by 2011), so it comes from, in order:
// void-634 (rev 634; no source found for its date) `examine` by loc id, then
// majula-289 (2005) `desc` by the same id. Ids are not all stable across that
// span (289's loc 4910 is a Barrel, 647's Commodore Matthias), so a desc taken
// by id can be another loc's; where the two disagree, void-634's text is the
// one shown. A loc another file already defines has its desc in that file's
// section instead. Grade D: reference data, not checked against the live 2011
// game text.
